#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:6
msgid "Command Line Interface"
msgstr "Antarmuka Baris Perintah"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:8
msgid ""
"Bring OpenShot into your command-line workflow. Import footage, trim and "
"arrange clips, apply effects, animate properties with keyframes, and export "
"videos from your terminal. Use a few commands to automate repetitive edits, "
"write a script for a recurring project, or let an AI agent help assemble and"
" refine a video."
msgstr ""
"Bawa OpenShot ke dalam alur kerja baris perintah Anda. Impor rekaman, potong"
" dan susun klip, terapkan efek, animasikan properti dengan keyframe, dan "
"ekspor video dari terminal Anda. Gunakan beberapa perintah untuk "
"mengotomatisasi pengeditan berulang, tulis skrip untuk proyek yang berulang,"
" atau biarkan agen AI membantu merakit dan menyempurnakan video."

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:13
msgid ""
"The command line works with the same projects as the editor. You can control"
" an open editor and review changes as you go, or work in a **headless "
"session** without opening a window. A session keeps your project open "
"between commands, including its edits, undo history, and export jobs. Save "
"it as an ``.osp`` project whenever you want to continue editing later."
msgstr ""
"Baris perintah bekerja dengan proyek yang sama seperti editor. Anda dapat "
"mengontrol editor yang terbuka dan meninjau perubahan saat berjalan, atau "
"bekerja dalam **sesi tanpa kepala** tanpa membuka jendela. Sesi menjaga "
"proyek Anda tetap terbuka antara perintah, termasuk pengeditannya, riwayat "
"batal, dan pekerjaan ekspor. Simpan sebagai proyek ``.osp`` kapan pun Anda "
"ingin melanjutkan pengeditan nanti."

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:20
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Memulai"

#: ../doc/agent_cli.rst:22
msgid ""
"Use your installed OpenShot executable followed by ``--cli``. Start with "
"``intro`` for a short guide to sessions, editing, animation, and saving, or "
"``help`` for the command overview. These commands do not need an active "
"session. The examples below require an OpenShot build that includes command-"
"line editing."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan executable OpenShot yang terpasang diikuti dengan ``--cli``. Mulai "
"dengan ``intro`` untuk panduan singkat tentang sesi, pengeditan, animasi, "
"dan penyimpanan, atau ``help`` untuk gambaran perintah. Perintah ini tidak "
"memerlukan sesi aktif. Contoh di bawah memerlukan build OpenShot yang "
"menyertakan pengeditan baris perintah."

